@startuml resolution_primitives
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Deterministic collision prerequisites
component "Travel-time schedules\nairborne vs ground occupancy" as TIMING <<app>>
component "Timed mover contact\nsquare / tick / first arrival" as CONTACT <<app>>
component "Ordered mine path contact\nclear / chase / detonate" as MINES <<app>>
component "Ray occupancy + cumulative path visibility\nfirst discovery and stop-before" as RAY <<app>>
component "Charon aimed / fire-and-forget strikes\nfirst BattleShip blocks each diagonal" as CHARON <<app>>
component "Simultaneous resolver + typed causal journal\nintegration pending" as RESOLVE <<app>>
TIMING --> CONTACT
CONTACT --> RESOLVE
MINES --> RESOLVE
RAY --> RESOLVE
CHARON --> RESOLVE
note bottom of RESOLVE
  Pure primitives retain canonical rule results.
  They do not yet emit loss receipts or authenticate witnesses.
  Attach causal events to actual mutations, not final snapshots.
end note
@enduml
